      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\n2007            3",
