    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-13-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13 Remuneration and allowances",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-1-sec-13-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A Commissioner is to be paid the remuneration that is determined\nby the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that\nremuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the Commissioner is\nto be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the regulations.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\n2007            7\n\n(2) A Commissioner is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by\nthe regulations.\n\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A Commissioner is to be paid the remuneration that is determined\nby the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that\nremuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the Commissioner is\nto be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the regulations.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\n2007            7\n\n(2) A Commissioner is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by\nthe regulations.\n\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-13-2-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-13-2-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-13-2-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bb6026579bc5d3288c417a160383d7296935426a230cb0577734103d6564eb7d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-1-sec-13-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13 Remuneration and allowances",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A Commissioner is to be paid the remuneration that is determined\nby the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that\nremuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the Commissioner is\nto be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the regulations.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\n2007            7\n\n(2) A Commissioner is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by\nthe regulations.\n\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973."
    },
