    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-29e",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "29E CEO not subject to direction by the Commission on certain",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-1-sec-29e"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "matters\n\nTo avoid doubt, the CEO is not subject to direction by the\nCommission in relation to the CEO’s performance of functions, or\nexercise of powers, under:\n\n(a) the Financial Management and Accountability Act 1997; or\n\n(b) the Public Service Act 1999;\nin relation to the Centre.",
      "skos:definition": "matters\n\nTo avoid doubt, the CEO is not subject to direction by the\nCommission in relation to the CEO’s performance of functions, or\nexercise of powers, under:\n\n(a) the Financial Management and Accountability Act 1997; or\n\n(b) the Public Service Act 1999;\nin relation to the Centre.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-29e-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-29e-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-29e-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-29e-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-29e-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-29e-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0e0b7a7234d9c9b0aa7f0c7898cea9f0e08c107e9b1838903d00363346ddbfef",
      "skos:note": "The CEO is not subject to direction by the Commission in relation to certain matters."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-1-sec-29e",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29E CEO not subject to direction by the Commission on certain",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "matters\n\nTo avoid doubt, the CEO is not subject to direction by the\nCommission in relation to the CEO’s performance of functions, or\nexercise of powers, under:\n\n(a) the Financial Management and Accountability Act 1997; or\n\n(b) the Public Service Act 1999;\nin relation to the Centre."
    },
