    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2 Vesting of assets of Centre",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies to the assets of the Centre immediately before the\ncommencement time.\n(2)\nAt the commencement time, the assets to which this item applies cease\nto be assets of the Centre and become assets of the Commonwealth\nwithout any conveyance, transfer or assignment. The Commonwealth\nbecomes the successor in law in relation to these assets.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies to the assets of the Centre immediately before the\ncommencement time.\n(2)\nAt the commencement time, the assets to which this item applies cease\nto be assets of the Centre and become assets of the Commonwealth\nwithout any conveyance, transfer or assignment. The Commonwealth\nbecomes the successor in law in relation to these assets.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "11d58a33f994693b034a94014cabade611ed2d5d910a5a9df797919dd5172f74",
      "skos:note": "Vesting of assets of Centre"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2 Vesting of assets of Centre",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 24,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies to the assets of the Centre immediately before the\ncommencement time.\n(2)\nAt the commencement time, the assets to which this item applies cease\nto be assets of the Centre and become assets of the Commonwealth\nwithout any conveyance, transfer or assignment. The Commonwealth\nbecomes the successor in law in relation to these assets."
    },
