    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3 Vesting of liabilities of Centre",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies to the liabilities of the Centre immediately before the\ncommencement time.\n(2)\nAt the commencement time, the liabilities to which this item applies\ncease to be liabilities of the Centre and become liabilities of the\nCommonwealth without any conveyance, transfer or assignment. The\nCommonwealth becomes the successor in law in relation to these\nliabilities.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies to the liabilities of the Centre immediately before the\ncommencement time.\n(2)\nAt the commencement time, the liabilities to which this item applies\ncease to be liabilities of the Centre and become liabilities of the\nCommonwealth without any conveyance, transfer or assignment. The\nCommonwealth becomes the successor in law in relation to these\nliabilities.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e8468db3ccb3c30dca0d8c4f5892685cfd9494f057f3c7fdd3735fd345eeef6f",
      "skos:note": "Vesting of liabilities of Centre"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 Vesting of liabilities of Centre",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 24,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies to the liabilities of the Centre immediately before the\ncommencement time.\n(2)\nAt the commencement time, the liabilities to which this item applies\ncease to be liabilities of the Centre and become liabilities of the\nCommonwealth without any conveyance, transfer or assignment. The\nCommonwealth becomes the successor in law in relation to these\nliabilities."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-3"
      },
