      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4 Certificates relating to vesting of land",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) any land vests in the Commonwealth under this Part; and\n\n(b) there is lodged with a land registration official a certificate\nthat:\n\n(i) is signed by the Minister; and\n\n(ii) identifies the land, whether by reference to a map or\notherwise; and\n\n(iii) states that the land has become vested in the\nCommonwealth under this Part.\nNote:\nCertificates under paragraph (1)(b) are presumed to be authentic: see item 17.\n(2)\nThe land registration official may:\n\n(a) register the matter in a way that is the same as, or similar to,\nthe way in which dealings in land of that kind are registered;\nand\n\n(b) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate.\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\nAssets, liabilities and legal proceedings  Part 2",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) any land vests in the Commonwealth under this Part; and\n\n(b) there is lodged with a land registration official a certificate\nthat:\n\n(i) is signed by the Minister; and\n\n(ii) identifies the land, whether by reference to a map or\notherwise; and\n\n(iii) states that the land has become vested in the\nCommonwealth under this Part.\nNote:\nCertificates under paragraph (1)(b) are presumed to be authentic: see item 17.\n(2)\nThe land registration official may:\n\n(a) register the matter in a way that is the same as, or similar to,\nthe way in which dealings in land of that kind are registered;\nand\n\n(b) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate.\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\nAssets, liabilities and legal proceedings  Part 2",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-4-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-4-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "79a49397902d1832f37af5389bb2d7870490c146e9afd819157aa9abe315322e",
      "skos:note": "Certificate required for land vesting in Commonwealth",
      "dc:description": "(1) Certificate signed by Minister, identifying land and stating it has vested in Commonwealth"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 Certificates relating to vesting of land",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 24,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) any land vests in the Commonwealth under this Part; and\n\n(b) there is lodged with a land registration official a certificate\nthat:\n\n(i) is signed by the Minister; and\n\n(ii) identifies the land, whether by reference to a map or\notherwise; and\n\n(iii) states that the land has become vested in the\nCommonwealth under this Part.\nNote:\nCertificates under paragraph (1)(b) are presumed to be authentic: see item 17.\n(2)\nThe land registration official may:\n\n(a) register the matter in a way that is the same as, or similar to,\nthe way in which dealings in land of that kind are registered;\nand\n\n(b) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate.\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\nAssets, liabilities and legal proceedings  Part 2"
    },
