    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5 Certificates relating to vesting of assets other than land",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) any asset other than land vests in the Commonwealth under\nthis Part; and\n\n(b) there is lodged with an assets official a certificate that:\n\n(i) is signed by the Minister; and\n\n(ii) identifies the asset; and\n\n(iii) states that the asset has become vested in the\nCommonwealth under this Part.\nNote:\nCertificates under paragraph (1)(b) are presumed to be authentic: see item 17.\n(2)\nThe assets official may:\n\n(a) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate as if it were a\nproper and appropriate instrument for transactions in relation\nto assets of that kind; and\n\n(b) make such entries in the register as are necessary, having\nregard to the effect of this Schedule.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) any asset other than land vests in the Commonwealth under\nthis Part; and\n\n(b) there is lodged with an assets official a certificate that:\n\n(i) is signed by the Minister; and\n\n(ii) identifies the asset; and\n\n(iii) states that the asset has become vested in the\nCommonwealth under this Part.\nNote:\nCertificates under paragraph (1)(b) are presumed to be authentic: see item 17.\n(2)\nThe assets official may:\n\n(a) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate as if it were a\nproper and appropriate instrument for transactions in relation\nto assets of that kind; and\n\n(b) make such entries in the register as are necessary, having\nregard to the effect of this Schedule.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-5-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-5-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-5-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-5-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "295333e681ec5fa9b258c4b6eb544a8fc61d3872066364bbb864e95e2c776f09",
      "skos:note": "Assets must be lodged with an assets official for vesting to occur."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 Certificates relating to vesting of assets other than land",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 25,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) any asset other than land vests in the Commonwealth under\nthis Part; and\n\n(b) there is lodged with an assets official a certificate that:\n\n(i) is signed by the Minister; and\n\n(ii) identifies the asset; and\n\n(iii) states that the asset has become vested in the\nCommonwealth under this Part.\nNote:\nCertificates under paragraph (1)(b) are presumed to be authentic: see item 17.\n(2)\nThe assets official may:\n\n(a) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate as if it were a\nproper and appropriate instrument for transactions in relation\nto assets of that kind; and\n\n(b) make such entries in the register as are necessary, having\nregard to the effect of this Schedule."
    },
    {
