      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 Transfer of custody of Centre or Board records",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies to any records or documents that, immediately before\nthe commencement time, were in the custody of the Centre or the\nBoard.\n(2)\nThe records and documents are to be transferred into the custody of the\nCEO at or after the commencement time.\n\nSchedule 2  Transitional provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies to any records or documents that, immediately before\nthe commencement time, were in the custody of the Centre or the\nBoard.\n(2)\nThe records and documents are to be transferred into the custody of the\nCEO at or after the commencement time.\n\nSchedule 2  Transitional provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-7-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "568c26f7e2aaf3f323af2e88fe3632466387221a778100e6f41d90843d36ff68",
      "skos:note": "Transfer of custody of Centre or Board records"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 Transfer of custody of Centre or Board records",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 25,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies to any records or documents that, immediately before\nthe commencement time, were in the custody of the Centre or the\nBoard.\n(2)\nThe records and documents are to be transferred into the custody of the\nCEO at or after the commencement time.\n\nSchedule 2  Transitional provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-7-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-7"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 References in instruments",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "References to Centre or Director taken to be references to CEO\nor Commonwealth\n(1)\nIf:\n\n(a) an instrument is in force immediately before the\ncommencement time; and\n\n(b) the instrument contains a reference to the Centre or to the\nDirector;\nthe instrument has effect from the commencement time as if the\nreference were a reference to the CEO.\n(2)\nHowever, if:\n\n(a) an instrument is in force immediately before the\ncommencement time; and\n\n(b) the instrument relates to assets or liabilities covered by item 2\nor 3; and\n\n(c) the instrument refers to the Centre or to the Director;\nthe reference is to be read as a reference to the Commonwealth as\nnecessary to give effect to item 2 or 3, as the case requires.\nReferences to Board taken to be references to Commission\n(3)\nIf:\n\n(a) an instrument is in force immediately before the\ncommencement time; and\n\n(b) the instrument contains a reference to the Board;\nthe instrument has effect from the commencement time as if the\nreference were a reference to the Commission.\nMinister and regulations may provide otherwise\n(4)\nThe Minister may, by writing, determine that subitem (1), (2) or (3):\n\n(a) does not apply in relation to a specified reference; or\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\nReference to, and things done by or in relation to, the Centre, the Director or the Board",
      "skos:definition": "References to Centre or Director taken to be references to CEO\nor Commonwealth\n(1)\nIf:\n\n(a) an instrument is in force immediately before the\ncommencement time; and\n\n(b) the instrument contains a reference to the Centre or to the\nDirector;\nthe instrument has effect from the commencement time as if the\nreference were a reference to the CEO.\n(2)\nHowever, if:\n\n(a) an instrument is in force immediately before the\ncommencement time; and\n\n(b) the instrument relates to assets or liabilities covered by item 2\nor 3; and\n\n(c) the instrument refers to the Centre or to the Director;\nthe reference is to be read as a reference to the Commonwealth as\nnecessary to give effect to item 2 or 3, as the case requires.\nReferences to Board taken to be references to Commission\n(3)\nIf:\n\n(a) an instrument is in force immediately before the\ncommencement time; and\n\n(b) the instrument contains a reference to the Board;\nthe instrument has effect from the commencement time as if the\nreference were a reference to the Commission.\nMinister and regulations may provide otherwise\n(4)\nThe Minister may, by writing, determine that subitem (1), (2) or (3):\n\n(a) does not apply in relation to a specified reference; or\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\nReference to, and things done by or in relation to, the Centre, the Director or the Board",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-8-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-8-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-8-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-8-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "eb65a9da5b2d313eb981ba43dde99d923562bc570efde18825b82fc1188d79e6",
      "skos:note": "References to Centre or Director taken to be references to CEO or Commonwealth"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 References in instruments",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "References to Centre or Director taken to be references to CEO\nor Commonwealth\n(1)\nIf:\n\n(a) an instrument is in force immediately before the\ncommencement time; and\n\n(b) the instrument contains a reference to the Centre or to the\nDirector;\nthe instrument has effect from the commencement time as if the\nreference were a reference to the CEO.\n(2)\nHowever, if:\n\n(a) an instrument is in force immediately before the\ncommencement time; and\n\n(b) the instrument relates to assets or liabilities covered by item 2\nor 3; and\n\n(c) the instrument refers to the Centre or to the Director;\nthe reference is to be read as a reference to the Commonwealth as\nnecessary to give effect to item 2 or 3, as the case requires.\nReferences to Board taken to be references to Commission\n(3)\nIf:\n\n(a) an instrument is in force immediately before the\ncommencement time; and\n\n(b) the instrument contains a reference to the Board;\nthe instrument has effect from the commencement time as if the\nreference were a reference to the Commission.\nMinister and regulations may provide otherwise\n(4)\nThe Minister may, by writing, determine that subitem (1), (2) or (3):\n\n(a) does not apply in relation to a specified reference; or\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\nReference to, and things done by or in relation to, the Centre, the Director or the Board"
    },
    {
