    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9 Operation of laws",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "Things done by Centre or Director taken to be done by CEO\n(1)\nIf, before the commencement time, a thing was done by, or in relation\nto, the Centre or the Director, then, for the purposes of the operation of\nany law of the Commonwealth after the commencement time, the thing\nis taken to have been done by, or in relation to, the CEO.\n(2)\nFor the purposes of subitem (1), a thing done before the commencement\ntime under a provision that is amended by this Act has effect from that\ntime as if it were done under that provision as amended. However, this\nis not taken to change the time at which the thing was actually done.\n\nSchedule 2  Transitional provisions",
      "skos:definition": "Things done by Centre or Director taken to be done by CEO\n(1)\nIf, before the commencement time, a thing was done by, or in relation\nto, the Centre or the Director, then, for the purposes of the operation of\nany law of the Commonwealth after the commencement time, the thing\nis taken to have been done by, or in relation to, the CEO.\n(2)\nFor the purposes of subitem (1), a thing done before the commencement\ntime under a provision that is amended by this Act has effect from that\ntime as if it were done under that provision as amended. However, this\nis not taken to change the time at which the thing was actually done.\n\nSchedule 2  Transitional provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-9-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "27a0c053fa75e7dff59652a7b694080e1fabbb2bd61fedd8a773ecb16d35caac",
      "skos:note": "Things done by Centre or Director taken to be done by CEO"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9 Operation of laws",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 27,
      "values:originalText": "Things done by Centre or Director taken to be done by CEO\n(1)\nIf, before the commencement time, a thing was done by, or in relation\nto, the Centre or the Director, then, for the purposes of the operation of\nany law of the Commonwealth after the commencement time, the thing\nis taken to have been done by, or in relation to, the CEO.\n(2)\nFor the purposes of subitem (1), a thing done before the commencement\ntime under a provision that is amended by this Act has effect from that\ntime as if it were done under that provision as amended. However, this\nis not taken to change the time at which the thing was actually done.\n\nSchedule 2  Transitional provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-9-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
