      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-10",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 Reporting requirements",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-10"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "Future reporting requirements\n(1)\nIf:\n\n(a) immediately before the commencement time, a law required\nthe Centre, the Director or the Board to provide a report\n(whether financial statements or otherwise) for a period; and\n\n(b) the period ends after the commencement time;\nthe CEO must provide the report, as required, for so much of the period\nas occurs before the commencement time.\n(2)\nIf:\n\n(a) under subitem (1), the CEO is required to provide a report for\na part of a period; and\n\n(b) the CEO is also required to provide a similar report for the\nremainder of the period;\nthe CEO may meet the requirements in a single report for the period.\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\nReference to, and things done by or in relation to, the Centre, the Director or the Board",
      "skos:definition": "Future reporting requirements\n(1)\nIf:\n\n(a) immediately before the commencement time, a law required\nthe Centre, the Director or the Board to provide a report\n(whether financial statements or otherwise) for a period; and\n\n(b) the period ends after the commencement time;\nthe CEO must provide the report, as required, for so much of the period\nas occurs before the commencement time.\n(2)\nIf:\n\n(a) under subitem (1), the CEO is required to provide a report for\na part of a period; and\n\n(b) the CEO is also required to provide a similar report for the\nremainder of the period;\nthe CEO may meet the requirements in a single report for the period.\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\nReference to, and things done by or in relation to, the Centre, the Director or the Board",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-10-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-10-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "64fca3b4a53f9d03ab07997272a9a8ca108b484cbfa182df9a9625c645137106",
      "skos:note": "Reporting requirements for CEO",
      "dc:description": "report, as required"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-10",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 Reporting requirements",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "Future reporting requirements\n(1)\nIf:\n\n(a) immediately before the commencement time, a law required\nthe Centre, the Director or the Board to provide a report\n(whether financial statements or otherwise) for a period; and\n\n(b) the period ends after the commencement time;\nthe CEO must provide the report, as required, for so much of the period\nas occurs before the commencement time.\n(2)\nIf:\n\n(a) under subitem (1), the CEO is required to provide a report for\na part of a period; and\n\n(b) the CEO is also required to provide a similar report for the\nremainder of the period;\nthe CEO may meet the requirements in a single report for the period.\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\nReference to, and things done by or in relation to, the Centre, the Director or the Board"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-10-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-10"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-10-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "CEO must provide report",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-2007-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2007 25",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-2007-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "Outstanding reporting requirements\n(3)\nIf:\n\n(a) a law required the Centre, the Director or the Board to\nprovide a report (whether financial statements or otherwise)\nfor a period that ended before the commencement time; and\n\n(b) the report has not been provided by the commencement time;\nthe CEO must provide the report as required.\nApplication of law to CEO\n(4)\nTo avoid doubt, if, under this item, the CEO is required to provide a\nreport under a law, the law applies to the CEO in respect of the report in\nthe same way as the law would have applied to the Centre, the Director\nor the Board in respect of the report.\n\nSchedule 2  Transitional provisions",
      "skos:definition": "Outstanding reporting requirements\n(3)\nIf:\n\n(a) a law required the Centre, the Director or the Board to\nprovide a report (whether financial statements or otherwise)\nfor a period that ended before the commencement time; and\n\n(b) the report has not been provided by the commencement time;\nthe CEO must provide the report as required.\nApplication of law to CEO\n(4)\nTo avoid doubt, if, under this item, the CEO is required to provide a\nreport under a law, the law applies to the CEO in respect of the report in\nthe same way as the law would have applied to the Centre, the Director\nor the Board in respect of the report.\n\nSchedule 2  Transitional provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-2007-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-2007-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9b9108dc3deaa320fabf614b4485fb94ee4117d27e53845e81feff37999ac3b7",
      "skos:note": "CEO must provide report if Centre, Director or Board failed to do so before commencement time.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-2007-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2007 25",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 29,
      "values:originalText": "Outstanding reporting requirements\n(3)\nIf:\n\n(a) a law required the Centre, the Director or the Board to\nprovide a report (whether financial statements or otherwise)\nfor a period that ended before the commencement time; and\n\n(b) the report has not been provided by the commencement time;\nthe CEO must provide the report as required.\nApplication of law to CEO\n(4)\nTo avoid doubt, if, under this item, the CEO is required to provide a\nreport under a law, the law applies to the CEO in respect of the report in\nthe same way as the law would have applied to the Centre, the Director\nor the Board in respect of the report.\n\nSchedule 2  Transitional provisions"
    },
