    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11 CEO",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe person holding office as the Director under section 24 of the old\nlaw immediately before the commencement time is taken, at the\ncommencement time, to have been duly appointed as the CEO by the\nGovernor-General under section 24 of the new law:\n\n(a) for the balance of the person’s term of appointment that\nremained immediately before the commencement time; and\n\n(b) on the same terms and conditions as applied to the person\nimmediately before the commencement time.\n(2)\nThis item does not prevent those terms and conditions being varied after\nthe commencement time.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe person holding office as the Director under section 24 of the old\nlaw immediately before the commencement time is taken, at the\ncommencement time, to have been duly appointed as the CEO by the\nGovernor-General under section 24 of the new law:\n\n(a) for the balance of the person’s term of appointment that\nremained immediately before the commencement time; and\n\n(b) on the same terms and conditions as applied to the person\nimmediately before the commencement time.\n(2)\nThis item does not prevent those terms and conditions being varied after\nthe commencement time.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-11-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-11-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b3639503fb6eba60218fe40bdd14d77e3929c6a1dcdf7c8c46158c79fd7934dc",
      "skos:note": "The person holding office as the Director is taken to have been duly appointed as CEO."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007#sch-2-sec-11",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11 CEO",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe person holding office as the Director under section 24 of the old\nlaw immediately before the commencement time is taken, at the\ncommencement time, to have been duly appointed as the CEO by the\nGovernor-General under section 24 of the new law:\n\n(a) for the balance of the person’s term of appointment that\nremained immediately before the commencement time; and\n\n(b) on the same terms and conditions as applied to the person\nimmediately before the commencement time.\n(2)\nThis item does not prevent those terms and conditions being varied after\nthe commencement time."
    },
