      "values:originalText": "An arrangement in force under section 31 of the old law immediately\nbefore the commencement time continues in force after that time as if it\nhad been entered into under section 31 of the new law.",
      "skos:definition": "An arrangement in force under section 31 of the old law immediately\nbefore the commencement time continues in force after that time as if it\nhad been entered into under section 31 of the new law.",
      "cml:asserts": [
