      "values:originalText": "(1)\nA person in respect of whom an engagement was in force under\nsection 32 of the old law immediately before the commencement time is\ntaken, at the commencement time, to have been engaged as a consultant\nunder section 32 of the new law.\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\nCEO, staff and consultants  Part 4",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nA person in respect of whom an engagement was in force under\nsection 32 of the old law immediately before the commencement time is\ntaken, at the commencement time, to have been engaged as a consultant\nunder section 32 of the new law.\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\nCEO, staff and consultants  Part 4",
      "cml:asserts": [
